    {"type":"text","id":"sum","x":60,"y":520,"width":1160,"height":50,"strokeColor":"#fbbf24","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":45,"text":"Summary: (a) 3/9 defer→PR-B (sibling theokit repo) · 6/9 n/a-declarative-or-docs   ·   (b) 4/9 PASS · 5/9 n/a   ·   (c) 1/9 PASS (THE GOAL) · 8/9 n/a","originalText":"Summary: (a) 3/9 defer→PR-B (sibling theokit repo) · 6/9 n/a-declarative-or-docs   ·   (b) 4/9 PASS · 5/9 n/a   ·   (c) 1/9 PASS (THE GOAL) · 8/9 n/a","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25,"version":1},
    {"type":"text","id":"foot","x":60,"y":620,"width":1160,"height":60,"strokeColor":"#8b949e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":46,"text":"★ T3.1 is THE GOAL — its pillar (c) is the runtime-metric proof per Global DoD (expect(intersect).toEqual([])).\nPillar (a) defers are HONEST — production callers live in scaffolded TheoKit apps per ADR D7; sibling theokit repo PR-B closes them.","originalText":"★ T3.1 is THE GOAL — its pillar (c) is the runtime-metric proof per Global DoD (expect(intersect).toEqual([])).\nPillar (a) defers are HONEST — production callers live in scaffolded TheoKit apps per ADR D7; sibling theokit repo PR-B closes them.","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25,"version":1}
